                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/releases/tag/v3.20.1"&gt;3.20.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensures we never load the Continuous Profiler on linux arm64, as it's unsupported. Loading an unloading the Continuous Profiler can trigger crash conditions on some old versions of glibc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Continuous Profiler&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don't load the profiler on arm64 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3195518714" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7169" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7169/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7169"&gt;#7169&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Miscellaneous&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;[fleet installer] Remove the global instrumentation commands (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3203043214" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7182" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7182/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7182"&gt;#7182&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Build / Test&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix release process by removing check for SSI artifacts (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3202911670" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7180" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7180/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7180"&gt;#7180&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add workaround for messed up execution_benchmark results (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3202987036" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/issues/7181" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7181/hovercard" href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/pull/7181"&gt;#7181&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-dotnet/compare/v3.20.0...v3.20.1"&gt;Changes since 3.20.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
